{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, take object, check status, perform task, or scan area if object is not visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectStatus    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
